#: ../developer/host-execution-limits.md:1
msgid "Host execution limits"
msgstr "主机执行限制"

#: ../developer/host-execution-limits.md:3
msgid ""
"Bounded workspace commands run in their own process groups inside the "
"retained sandbox. Their PID records include the Linux start time, and "
"cleanup verifies both the UID and process identity before signalling that"
" group. A command's timeout or output overflow therefore preserves "
"concurrent native sessions and terminals in the shared container. Zombie "
"processes awaiting the container's init reap do not count as surviving "
"command writers."
msgstr ""
"有时间和输出上限的工作区命令，在保留沙箱里各自运行在单独的进程组中。它们的 PID 记录里带有 Linux 启动时间；清理时先同时核对 UID "
"和进程身份，确认无误后才向这个进程组发信号。所以一条命令超时或输出超限，不会波及同一个容器里同时在跑的原生会话和终端。等待容器 init "
"回收的僵尸进程，不算作还在写入的命令进程。"

#: ../developer/host-execution-limits.md:10
msgid ""
"Host readers drain stdout and stderr in 64 KiB chunks. Command stdout "
"limits apply while those chunks arrive; stderr keeps at most 256 KiB of "
"diagnostic bytes. Queues hold at most four items and apply backpressure, "
"with cancellation when their consumer exits. Native CLI records have an 8"
" MiB byte limit; sandbox manager NDJSON frames have a 32 MiB limit to "
"account for normalized content, the raw record, and JSON escaping. An "
"oversized native record stops its member process through the same scoped "
"cleanup path. Setup and runner diagnostic tails are also bounded by "
"bytes."
msgstr ""
"主机端以 64 KiB 为一块读取 stdout 和 stderr。命令的 stdout 上限在读取过程中就开始生效；stderr 最多保留 "
"256 KiB 的诊断内容。队列最多放四项，满了就让生产方等待，消费方退出时队列随之取消。原生 CLI 的单条记录上限是 8 "
"MiB；sandbox manager 的 NDJSON 帧上限是 32 MiB，因为一帧里要装下规范化后的内容、原始记录和 JSON "
"转义。原生记录超限时，会走同一条限定范围的清理路径，停掉对应的成员进程。setup 和 runner 的诊断日志尾部同样按字节数设了上限。"

#: ../developer/host-execution-limits.md:19
msgid ""
"Each normalized event is bounded to 256 KiB of JSON where the host "
"creates it, and again where the control plane receives it. Text Postgres "
"cannot store is replaced first: a NUL, which a tool printing binary or "
"NUL-separated output emits, and an unpaired surrogate, which a CLI leaves"
" when it cuts a string inside a surrogate pair, each become U+FFFD. The "
"event is kept rather than refused, because a runner that cannot record an"
" event ends its turn. The same replacement applies to everything the "
"runner posts to the control plane, and again to the reason it gives when "
"it releases an activation or ends a turn, which quotes what the CLI "
"printed: a refused reason would leave the turn on its lease. The runner "
"also cuts a release's reason to the 1000 characters the control plane "
"accepts (`ABANDON_DETAIL_MAX_CHARS`), as it cuts a heartbeat's launch "
"error, because a longer one would have the whole release refused."
msgstr ""
"每个规范化后的事件，在主机生成时限制在 256 KiB 的 JSON 以内，控制平面收到时还会再限制一次。Postgres "
"存不了的文本会先被替换掉：NUL（工具输出二进制内容或用 NUL 分隔的内容时会产生）和落单的代理项（CLI "
"在一个代理对中间截断字符串时会留下）都会变成 U+FFFD。事件会保留下来，而不是被拒绝，因为 runner "
"一旦记录不了事件，就会结束这一轮。runner "
"发给控制平面的所有内容都做同样的替换；它在释放一次激活或结束一轮时给出的原因也一样，因为这个原因会引用 CLI "
"打印的内容，而原因一旦被拒，这一轮就会一直挂在它的租约上。runner 还会把释放原因截到控制平面接受的 1000 "
"个字符以内（`ABANDON_DETAIL_MAX_CHARS`），就像它截断心跳里的启动错误一样，因为原因再长的话，整个释放请求都会被拒绝。"

#: ../developer/host-execution-limits.md:32
msgid ""
"Resource checkpoints are forwarded independently of native CLI events. A "
"silent model or tool invocation can therefore persist its latest sampled "
"checkpoint before emitting another message. The existing final report "
"remains the authoritative closing measurement."
msgstr ""
"资源检查点和原生 CLI "
"事件是分开转发的。所以即使模型或工具调用一直没有输出，最近一次采样的检查点也能在下一条消息出来之前保存下来。收尾时的最终报告仍然是权威的测量结果。"

#: ../developer/host-execution-limits.md:37
msgid ""
"Disk space is guarded only at admission: the runner declines a turn that "
"would create a sandbox when free space is below the [storage reserve"
"](runtime-settings.md). Nothing bounds what a running sandbox writes "
"except an optional per-container disk limit; see [sandbox "
"settings](operations.md#sandbox-settings)."
msgstr ""
"磁盘空间只在准入时检查：可用空间低于[存储预留](runtime-settings.md)时，runner "
"不会接需要新建沙箱的轮次。至于运行中的沙箱写了多少，除了可选的单容器磁盘上限，没有任何限制，见[沙箱设置](operations.md"
"#sandbox-settings)。"

